                <pb facs="0300" n="188" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg188"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.20261/64: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Sweden</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wheeler</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-07T16:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 7, 1919, 4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 10:37 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>3977. Your 1662 of July 1st was on July 5th communicated textually to the Soviet
                    Government through the Swedish Government wireless by Mr. Emanuele
                        Stang of Christiania, attorney for Lomonossoff.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Wheeler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
